WEBVTT

00:05:59.890 --> 00:06:02.528
(Laughter)

00:06:02.552 --> 00:06:05.226
(Applause)

00:06:05.250 --> 00:06:07.767
We demand perfection from feminists,

00:06:07.791 --> 00:06:10.148
because we are still fighting for so much,

00:06:10.172 --> 00:06:11.469
we want so much,

00:06:11.493 --> 00:06:13.026
we need so damn much.

00:06:13.395 --> 00:06:16.575
We go far beyond reasonable,
constructive criticism,

00:06:16.599 --> 00:06:19.348
to dissecting any given woman's feminism,

00:06:19.372 --> 00:06:21.753
tearing it apart
until there's nothing left.

00:06:22.253 --> 00:06:23.642
We do not need to do that.

00:06:24.452 --> 00:06:28.559
Bad feminism -- or really, more inclusive
feminism -- is a starting point.

00:06:28.583 --> 00:06:30.036
But what happens next?